      "message": "Are you 100% sure that these complex checks are needed. As I understand it append and FirstUniqueStrings both return nil if passed a nil list that is appended to a nil list.\n\nI wasn\u0027t sure myself (and the documentation does not cover it) and ran the following test:\n\nfunc TestNilList(t *testing.T) {\n\th :\u003d TestHelper{t}\n\t\n\tvar a []string\n\th.AssertDeepEquals(\"nil\", []string(nil), a)\n\th.AssertDeepEquals(\"nil - append nil\", []string(nil), append(a, a...))\n\th.AssertDeepEquals(\"nil - append a\", []string{\"a\"}, append(a, \"a\"))\n\th.AssertDeepEquals(\"{b} - append nil\", []string{\"b\"}, append([]string{\"b\"}, a...))\n\th.AssertDeepEquals(\"nil - [:0]\", []string(nil), a[:0])\n}",
